# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .gitignore for a SQL Server Data Tools (SSDT) database project
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Build output ----------------------------------------------------------
# The compiled .dacpac, the generated deploy script and CLR build artifacts all
# land here. All are reproducible from source, so none of it is committed.
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
*.dacpac
*.dll
*.pdb
*.exe

# --- Visual Studio local state ---------------------------------------------
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.rsuser
*.userprefs

# --- SSDT-specific local caches --------------------------------------------
# .dbmdl  : Visual Studio's cached database model (~10 MB, rebuilt on open)
# .jfm    : SSDT journal file, local scratch state
# .sqlproj.user : per-developer debug/deploy settings
*.dbmdl
*.jfm
*.sqlproj.user

# NOTE: MarketData.DB.refactorlog is intentionally NOT ignored. It records
# rename operations so that deployments apply them as renames instead of
# drop-and-recreate. Losing it can mean losing data on the next publish.

# --- Local deployment profiles ---------------------------------------------
# The checked-in MarketData.DB.publish.xml is the shared profile. Create
# additional *.local.publish.xml files for machine-specific connections; they
# stay out of source control.
*.local.publish.xml
*.publish.local.xml

# --- SQL / tooling scratch -------------------------------------------------
*.dtbcache
*.sqlsuo
*.scmp
*.bak
*.trn
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.ndf
*.log
UpgradeLog*.htm
UpgradeLog*.XML

# --- NuGet / MSBuild -------------------------------------------------------
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
project.lock.json
project.assets.json
msbuild.log
msbuild.err
msbuild.wrn

# --- OS / editor -----------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# --- Local agent/tooling settings ------------------------------------------
.claude/settings.local.json
*.local.json
